<title>UK: Westfaelische Hypo sets structured five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Westfaelische Hypo sets structured five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   BASE	*6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    11.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *0.20 PCT  PAY DATE    11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     ISS PRICE  100.0</p>
<p> NOTES     *MAXIMUM COUPON IS PRECEEDING COUPON PLUS 40 BP</p>
<p>		MINIMUM COUPON IS PRECEEDING COUPON</p>
<p>		FIRST COUPON IS SET AT 3.41875 PCT</p>
<p> LISTING    DDF	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 3926</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
